Detailed Daily Bid Report Procedure Report
Document Overview

This report summarizes the process outlined in Daily Bid Report Procedure - Updated - 02-09-2026 1.docx for generating, processing, assigning, reporting, and distributing the Daily Bid Report within Property Preservation Operations.

1. Purpose

The Daily Bid Report process ensures that all aged property preservation bids are reviewed, assigned appropriately, monitored against Service Level Agreements (SLAs), and communicated to responsible team members on a daily basis. The report provides visibility into:

Open bids
Hold for Review bids
Pending bids
Aged items exceeding SLA requirements
Employee workload distribution
Past due bid management

The final deliverable is distributed to the Property Preservation team for action and tracking.

